{"duration": 37.12, "lines": [{"t": 0.51, "d": 0.85, "text": "Martin…"}, {"t": 2.27, "d": 1.02, "text": "It's Jack."}, {"t": 4.55, "d": 2.77, "text": "I… I've called a few times now."}, {"t": 8.24, "d": 3.66, "text": "I know you're probably… I don't know. Sleeping. Or whatever."}, {"t": 12.71, "d": 3.27, "text": "Sarah and I were talking about you last night."}, {"t": 16.59, "d": 1.52, "text": "We're worried, man."}, {"t": 19.12, "d": 2.38, "text": "You don't pick up. You don't call back."}, {"t": 22.22, "d": 1.62, "text": "It's not like you."}, {"t": 25.57, "d": 2.14, "text": "Not since Mom and Dad."}, {"t": 28.83, "d": 3.16, "text": "Just… call me. Okay? Even if it's late."}, {"t": 32.9, "d": 1.19, "text": "I'll stay up."}, {"t": 34.81, "d": 2.01, "text": "Talk to you soon, brother."}]}